Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,公元517年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The year is 517 A.D.,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,史称黑暗时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}known as the Dark Ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而名字的来由显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for fucking good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场人类军队与黑暗生物之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}An endless war between the armies of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永无休止的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the creatures of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,席卷了英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}has raged across Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了报复人类对黑暗生物的不公之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in retribution for man's injustices to creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生不死的女巫薇薇安·妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the immortal witch Vivienne Nimue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,传播了致命的瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}had spread her deadly plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,威胁要把人类从地球上彻底消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}threatening to wipe mankind off the face of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}彭德尔山\N公元517年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:01:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是在彭德尔山上 一棵古老的橡树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so at Pendle Hill, beneath an ancient oak tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟王 没错 就是那个亚瑟王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Arthur… Yes, that King Arthur,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他法术高强的巫师梅林\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his powerful wizard Merlin,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.59,0:01:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,被迫向血皇后妮缪投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}were forced to surrender to Nimue, the Queen of Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.19,0:01:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的亚瑟王驾临彭德尔山\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great King Arthur comes to Pendle Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.18,0:01:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 带着深信人类与怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, believing man and monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远也无法和睦共处的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}were never meant to live in harmony,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.66,0:01:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟偷袭了妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur ambushed Nimue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.94,0:01:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而她最信任的女巫戈内达背叛了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betrayed by her most trusted witch, Ganeida.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡人的兵器伤不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No mortal weapon can harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 王者之剑 - 这可不是凡人的兵器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excalibur! - This is no mortal weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,盛怒之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pissed off,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪释放了致命的瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue unleashed her deadly plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.37,0:02:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.05,0:02:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻一挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}With one swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的王者之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}of his legendary sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟砍下了血皇后之首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur severed the Blood Queen's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便如此 也无法阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even that wasn't enough to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他将血皇后砍碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he had her cut up into pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.91,0:02:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将每一块都分别锁在不同的棺材里\N{\fnArial\fs30}each one locked in a separate casket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切尚未结束 我永生永世都要复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not over. I am vengeance eternal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣的祷告者将其封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sealed with a holy prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有圣徒的言语才能打破这道圣印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the words from a man of God may break this holy seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后 亚瑟命令其最勇敢的骑士们骑马离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur then ordered his bravest knights to ride off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,将她邪恶的残骸埋葬在大地尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bury her wretched remains in the far reaches of the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能找到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where no one would ever find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是魔鬼本尊也无济于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}地狱男爵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:02:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准喝酒 不准打架 不要挑事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No drinking, no fighting, don't cause a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.59,0:03:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}提华纳\N今时今日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 别紧张 我又不是第一次来提华纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Dad. It's not my first time in Tijuana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.27,0:03:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我为什么要跟你说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I'm telling you all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伊兹是我朋友 我只是想把他带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruiz is my friend. I just wanna bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.57,0:03:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伊兹探员不是你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Ruiz is not your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是你的一个酒友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's someone you get drunk with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派鲁伊兹探去调查一个吸血鬼巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}we sent Ruiz to investigate a nest of vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,自那之后 他就没消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't heard from him since.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到可靠消息 知道在哪能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reliable source told me where I can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他就打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me when you have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会打给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给我 这是个简单的寻人任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call me! It's a simple extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,带鲁伊兹离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Ruiz out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说声再见就闪人 别又把事情搞大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bid adios without making a big mess. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的 我很温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me, I have a gentle touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 又坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}摔跤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camazotz! Camazotz! Camazotz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camazotz! Camazotz! Camazotz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos（250，220）}今晚我们请来了一位名人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}世上最伟大的超自然现象调查员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}地狱男爵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}我们打一场 不死不休
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伊兹 埃斯特班 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruiz! Esteban, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos（150，220）}埃斯特班 我不是他了 我是坎马卓兹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camazotz! Camazotz! Camazotz! Camazotz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎马卓兹 坎马卓兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camazotz! Camazotz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎马卓兹是什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with the Camazotz crap, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,超自然调查防御局派你来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The B.P.R.D. sends you down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查一个吸血鬼巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}investigate a nest of vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你三周前失联了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you went silent about three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.11,0:05:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 我是来带你回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'm here to bring you back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 兄弟 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就来带我回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come on, bring me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.41,0:05:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}对打 对打 对打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}上吧 恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}野兽去死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Hey, what happened to you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是什么打扮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the get-up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos（150，220）}我在训练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练 训练什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training? Training for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.15,0:05:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 帮我拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Hang on to that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫色很适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good in purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伊兹 我们去喝杯酒好好聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruiz! Let's have a drink and talk about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good agent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 别这样 你不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, come on. Come on, don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在后院 坐在门廊喝啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backyards? Drinking beers on the porch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还一起弹过吉他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to play guitar, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你弹的都是不插电的嬉皮士垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You-you'd play all that hippy acoustic crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我弹的才叫音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd play real music.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hell with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我不想弄伤你 搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I don't wanna hurt you, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还没有完全迷失 回应我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there somewhere. Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢扮英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play the hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道面具之下你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I really know what is under your mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那我们就揭开你的面具看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Is that so? Let's see what's under yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伊兹 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruiz! Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.13,0:07:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伊兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你 阿努·恩·罗摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you… Anung un Rama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心因愤怒而跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heart beats with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你最终会选择哪一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know which side you'll choose at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是故意的 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I didn't mean… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.39,0:08:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}终结即将来临…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是生性如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just doing what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会怪你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not judging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是乔什\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's Josh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常被人认错\N{\fnArial\fs30}People confuse us all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,推特 你可算不上低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twitter. You don't exactly blend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伊兹的事我很遗憾 但我们得带你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, sorry about Ruiz, but we gotta take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can try!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 大块头 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, big guy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是奉命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just following orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老头派你们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只跟我们说事关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he told us is its important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}再给我拿一瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们买单\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}科罗拉多州
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}超自然调查防御局
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弗吉尼亚·佩恩\N维克托·凯斯特勒\N埃斯特班·鲁伊兹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}超自然调查防御局
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥的悲剧事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Details are still emerging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍不断有细节浮出水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}with regard to the tragic events in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于地狱男爵 以及他效力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's very little information known about Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘机构 我们知之甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the secretive agency that apparently he works for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你漏了一块 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed a spot. May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father used to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,刮胡子是一天之中最重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}shaving was the most important part of a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绅士和{\u1}非利士人{\u0}的区别
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有真男人才会每天拿着刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes a real man to hold a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵在自己的喉咙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}against his own throat every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不割断颈静脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not cut the jugular.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁姆爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa Bruttenholm,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心中尽是泰迪熊和彩虹\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was all teddy bears and rainbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个冥顽不灵的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was an unrepentant asshole,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他教会了我怎么刮胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he taught me how to shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.11,0:11:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其父必有其子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like father, like son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在龙舌兰酒里烂醉三周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drowning in tequila for three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能暂时麻痹伤痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}may temporarily numb the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实只会加剧你的悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it ever really does is exacerbate your sorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶化你的肝脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the state of your liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道鲁伊兹探员的事让你很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're upset about Agent Ruiz,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这份工作就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都明白这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone here knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我杀了他 不是工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job didn't kill him, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在圣母瓜达卢佩教堂边上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I buried him 16 feet under the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.87,0:11:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他埋在了十六英尺深的地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}right by the chapel of the Virgin Guadalupe,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了能让他安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to make it proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成了邪恶的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had become unholy, a vampyre,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可救药的黑暗生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}a creature of darkness beyond salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可救药的黑暗生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A creature of darkness beyond salvation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说不是每个人都能像我一样偶尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, we don't all just deserve a little gentle horn shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 磨一磨角吗 - 你不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- every now and then? - You're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.53,0:12:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的脸能说话 一定会反对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my face could talk, it would disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你的脸很帅气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a beautiful face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结即将来临 什么终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end is coming. The end of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这是鲁伊兹的临终遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Those were Ruiz's last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么阿努·恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and something about Anung nun…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it ring any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 世界末日的胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. Apocalyptic mutterings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 真是帅气逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there… Don't you look handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你的话 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take your word for that, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 你为什么叫我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you bring me back, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说是因为你想我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me it's 'cause you miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得俄赛里斯会社吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recall the Osiris Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得 泽西岛的脱衣舞俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Strip joint in Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳神厄里奥皮克兄弟协会的资深成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British occult society formed in 1866.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1866年成立的英国秘会\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the ranking members of the Heliopic Brotherhood of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳神 我在阴间见过太阳神一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ra? I met Ra once in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢近距离和人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a close-talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们一样 他们也对抗黑暗势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like us, they fight against the forces of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的组织之间有长期的合作关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our organizations have a long-standing relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're old friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想请你帮忙解决一个巨大的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've requested your assistance with a giant problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 什么问题 - 巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? What's that? - Giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵剥夺了我可能拥有的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy stole the life I might've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我放逐到这个悲惨的境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banished me into an existence of misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我活着就是为了杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now only live to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也遭受过地狱男爵的摧残\N{\fnArial\fs30}I too have suffered at Hellboy's hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我了解你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I know your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感同身受 所以我召唤你前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt yours, so I summoned you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你去找一位女巫 薇薇安·妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will guide you to a witch, Vivienne Nimue,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然被砍碎 但她还活着并持机等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut to pieces but alive and waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,复原她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restore her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会让你再次强大起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will make you powerful again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就能复仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can have your vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 过程会很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thank you. - This is not going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为了恢复力量 我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to be whole again, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 这事对你有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就不用你操心了 野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is no concern of yours, beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 我自有安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the end, I'll have my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而地狱男爵将会付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Hellboy will pay what he owes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}英国
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}俄赛里斯会社
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的客人到了 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guest, m'lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 欢迎 我是亚当·格拉伦勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy, welcome. Lord Adam Glaren.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.93,0:15:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,请容我为你介绍我的同僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may I introduce my associates,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德文·卡普博士和奥古斯特·斯温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Edwin Carp and August Swain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 你们去过泽西岛的俄赛里斯俱乐部吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. You guys ever been to the Osiris Club in Jersey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这里差不多 不过那里有脱衣舞女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like this, but just with strippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以摸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何特别之处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it do anything special?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 砸起东西来得心应手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it smashes things real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很高兴你接受了我们的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so very glad you accepted our invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得可选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't really my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 教授让你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. The Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你父亲是老相识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father and I go back a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有所耳闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:16:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄赛里斯会社一直致力于保存\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Osiris Club has been long dedicated to preserving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大不列颠的秘史\N{\fnArial\fs30}the secret history of Great Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于像你这样的人 会社为我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It affords us certain insights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供了独到的见解\N{\fnArial\fs30}into individuals such as yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有时也会向你们超自然调查防御局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've also given vital counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供重要的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your B.P.R.D. on occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们别废话了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe we could just get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们让我飞越了半个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you flew me halfway around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了给我上一堂历史课\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so that we could, uh, have a little history lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们应该直接展示给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should just show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人曾经统治过不列颠群岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giants once dominated the British Isles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.99,0:16:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群邪恶的 令人作呕的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vile, loathsome creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,既可能看你一眼 又可能一口吃掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As likely to eat you as look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们一直都是个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've always been a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个英国到处都埋着他们的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodies buried all over England.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人有一个古怪的特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a curious feature of giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们偶尔会从坟墓中爬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they occasionally rise from their graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大肆破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wreak havoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种时候 我们就会组织一场狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they do, we organize a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}欧洲民间神话 超自然的猎人在野外追逐猎物\N通常预示着灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我的头就够大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought I had a big head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你们在这方面是老鸟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, you guys are old pros at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么还要我来帮你们杀一个巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need me to help you kill a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three giants, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个 我们没问题 甚至两个也能对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, we can handle, perhaps even two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是三个加在一起 就是另外一回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But three, that's a different matter altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个特殊的三人组\N{\fnArial\fs30}This particular trio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,威胁着{\u1}新森林{\u0}地区{\fs14}[英国南部]{\fs}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is terrorizing the New Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吮吸那些不幸与之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucking on the bones of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生冲突的人的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}unlucky enough to fall foul of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 他们对骨髓欲罢不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The marrow, you see. They can't get enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有巨人到达人口密集的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if any were to reach a population center…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Miller time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是轻而易举的任务 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a task to be taken lightly, Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是巨人僵尸 非常难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Gigantum Mortis. Very unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你父亲就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ask your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔沃也曾受邀加入狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trevor was a guest of the hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在1943年合力干掉了一个巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we took one down in '43.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.89,0:17:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就知道我爸老得很慢 但是你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew Dad aged well, but you guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片就像是昨天拍的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picture looks like it was taken yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才准确地观察到的现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phenomenon you so rightly observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,源自于一场降神会\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the byproduct of a seance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:18:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们四个人 还有你父亲布鲁姆教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}the four of us, along with your Professor Broom,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都参与了\N{\fnArial\fs30}were involved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在战争爆发前\N{\fnArial\fs30}just before the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请容我介绍我们的常驻先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce our resident seer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白·哈顿夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Elizabeth Hatton.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上我接触到的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit I made contact with that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,异常地强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}was exceptionally powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它警告我们有东西即将出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}It warned us that something was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会终结人类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that would end mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们被选中去寻找并摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that we'd been chosen to seek it out and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,自那之后 我们以蜗牛的速度缓慢衰老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since, we've aged at a snail's pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了完成那个使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to fulfill that mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论要耗费多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how long it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们担心的这个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And this thing you're worried about,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它出现了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did it show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来到这个世界的那晚 我就在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there the night that you came into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时第二次世界大战已接近尾声\N{\fnArial\fs30}World War II was coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国几乎被击败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Germany was all but defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是纳粹还藏了最后一手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Nazis still had one last trick up their sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们求助于臭名昭著的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned to the infamous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,死灵法师格里戈里·拉斯普京\N{\fnArial\fs30}necromancer Grigori Rasputin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在苏格兰海岸外的一个小岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On an island off the coast of Scotland,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们聚在一起进行古老的神秘仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}they gathered to invoke an ancient occult ritual…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要把战局扭转成对德国有利的局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}intended to turn the tide of war back in Germany's favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是出了差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式没有完全按照他们的计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual didn't turn out quite as they planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2}杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,传奇纳粹猎人 龙虾队长赶到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}legendary Nazi hunter the Lobster arrived…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.55,0:19:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guten Tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,带领盟军进行了大胆的突袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading the allies on a daring raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.53,0:20:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 让魔鬼知道是谁杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, so the devil knows who sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.35,0:20:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos（250，220）}去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.33,0:20:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你们这些踢正步的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the rest of you goose-stepping bastards,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我的热能手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}beware of my claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是来将你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I have come to inflict justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.97,0:20:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳之以法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁姆教授和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Broom and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.93,0:21:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时在和盟军合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}were working with the allies at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭借他对神秘仪式的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his knowledge of the occult.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我预见未来的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my gift of foresight,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们率领秘密任务到达岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}we led a secret mission to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备杀死那晚从地狱深处召唤出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill whatever abomination was summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何可憎之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the depths of hell that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们发现了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, we found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲从没跟你提起过 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father never told you, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚他究竟为什么在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why he was really there that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是忘说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've slipped his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯普京把你作为武器带到了这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rasputin brought you in the world as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀着耐心和理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}With patience and understanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁姆把那件武器变成了行善的利器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broom turned that weapon into a force for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.69,0:22:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「耐心和理解」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Patience and understanding."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.44,0:22:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定我们说的是同一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we're talking about the same guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.41,0:22:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在你身上看到了我们其他人看不到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw something in you that the rest of us could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你当自己的儿子养大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he raised you as his own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该休息一下 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get some rest, Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,黎明时集合狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunt will assemble at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.26,0:22:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不仅是恶魔之子 还是纳粹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm devil spawn and a Nazi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 多谢 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.66,0:22:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}爸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}圣赛巴斯蒂安修道院
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}请尊重我们的静默誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.56,0:23:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}这么晚不会是访客
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.61,0:23:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}别开门
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪儿 修道士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it, monk?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.35,0:23:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你们这些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you fucking bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.39,0:23:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你们敢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here! Have you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.43,0:24:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇 尖叫算不算打破你们的静默誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder, does screaming break your vow of silence, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.43,0:24:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在找什么 它在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm looking for. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.85,0:24:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.01,0:24:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.43,0:24:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 修道士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, monk!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.34,0:25:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈讨厌铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fuckin' hate iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.58,0:25:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开它 念咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it. Speak the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道只有圣徒的言语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know only the words from a man of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.66,0:25:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能打破这道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}can break the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.50,0:25:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快他妈打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.89,0:25:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道什么事都得我自己做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I gotta do everything meself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.38,0:25:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gobshite.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.70,0:25:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我们是去讨糖果还是狩猎巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are we trick-or-treating or hunting giants?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.60,0:25:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是传统 向以前勇敢的猎人致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tradition. To honor the brave huntsmen who've come before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.67,0:26:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这些长刺刀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pig stickers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.95,0:26:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.13,0:26:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,古往今来被巨人杀手所使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used by giant slayers throughout the ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.21,0:26:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然也经过了现代技术的改造\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a few modern modifications, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.24,0:26:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,比电椅的威力强五倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five times as potent as an electric chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.24,0:26:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒你一下 这不足以杀死巨人 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough to kill a giant, mind you. But, uh, still,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.11,0:26:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以轻易制服那些生物 你想要一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite handy in subduing the creatures. Would you care for one?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我有自己的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, I got traditions of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我不用戴帽子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. I don't have to wear the hat, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.46,0:26:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我们很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're very well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.18,0:26:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对头上的角很抵触\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your distaste for horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.28,0:26:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过作为狩猎大师 戴上这件头饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my honor, as master of the hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.69,0:26:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wear the headdress.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.24,0:26:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后是这个 暗影\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are. Long Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有吉普车或摩托车之类的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have a jeep or a motorcycle or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.85,0:26:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不太公平 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wouldn't be very sporting now, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.04,0:26:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会安全带你回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll bring you home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.30,0:26:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,事先声明 这不是我的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, this wasn't my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.35,0:27:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,和哈顿夫人预言的一样 有三组踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three sets of tracks. Just as Lady Hatton foretold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.67,0:27:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到四具尸体 虽然是残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count four bodies. Parts of them, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.91,0:27:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会回来的 - 你为什么这么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They'll be back. - What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.23,0:27:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人是不会留下食物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giants don't leave food behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.42,0:27:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,踪迹向北 朝河的方向去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tracks are heading north, toward the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在这里战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we'll make our stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.77,0:27:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会从桥上过河\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll use the bridge to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.13,0:27:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在任意一边的灌木丛中占据位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take up positions in the brush on either side.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.57,0:27:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 看起来是个偷袭的绝佳地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, seems like a perfect spot for an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}My thoughts exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们上 - 干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get him! - Take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.24,0:28:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追\N{\fnArial\fs30}After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.20,0:28:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,打倒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.51,0:28:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think we needed your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.48,0:29:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能去杀我们猎杀了几个世纪的巨人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill something we've been hunting for centuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.10,0:29:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们决不允许魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will never allow the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.15,0:29:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐上英格兰的王座\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sit on the throne of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.83,0:29:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将引发世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would usher in the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.49,0:29:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.82,0:29:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当哈顿夫人第一次告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Lady Hatton first told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.33,0:29:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对未来的预见和必须做的事的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}about her vision and what needed to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.52,0:29:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hesitant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁姆对你的潜力很有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broom was so certain of your potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.74,0:29:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且你做了很多善事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have done so much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.63,0:29:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是命运是变幻无常的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But fate is a fickle beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.16,0:29:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在我必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.26,0:29:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲多年前就该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what your father should have done those many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.26,0:29:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.35,0:30:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头颅将成为我们陈列室的一大亮点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's any consolation, your head will make.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.65,0:30:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这能让你略感安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wonderful addition to our gallery.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.52,0:30:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.61,0:30:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.86,0:30:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是同一个脚趾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was the same toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.49,0:30:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想象不到我杀了多少人才拿到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how many I had to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.78,0:30:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就能让你玩上「扭扭乐」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have you playing Twister in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.05,0:30:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 玩笑开得太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.94,0:30:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的努力很快就会得到回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon you shall reap the reward for your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.09,0:31:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你会不会觉得饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if you'd be hungry or what, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.69,0:31:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我在箱子里待一千年 肯定饿疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand years in a box and I'd be starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.90,0:31:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信现在的人都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe what people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.27,0:31:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱扔些什么东西 饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}throw away these days. Cookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇是我唯一需要的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge is the only sustenance I require.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.61,0:31:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.14,0:31:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个饱受战争和贫穷蹂躏的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world ravaged by war and poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.33,0:31:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,被无能的恐惧贩子的领导着\N{\fnArial\fs30}led by feckless fear mongers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用歌唱比赛取代了剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've replaced swords with singing competitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.75,0:31:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们时日无多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.04,0:31:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的另一条手臂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my other hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定能找回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're certain you can retrieve it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.29,0:31:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.71,0:31:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你会遵守承诺复原我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll restore me, as you promised?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.57,0:31:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 你会得到应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, you'll get what's due.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.84,0:31:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好事会降临在耐心等待的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All good things come to those who wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.33,0:31:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把最后一个箱子给我 让我再次完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me the last box. Make me whole again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.87,0:31:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们将一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And together,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.66,0:31:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,用鲜血为这个世界洗礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will baptize this world in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.86,0:32:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真疼 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.33,0:32:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.23,0:32:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们还是需要我的帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you did need my help after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.59,0:32:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为有三个巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there was supposed to be three.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.53,0:33:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 明天早上我肯定浑身酸痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I'm gonna feel that in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,到爸爸这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.75,0:33:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still, handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.37,0:33:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面真他妈湿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fucking wet in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.58,0:34:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.71,0:34:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都吃了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you been eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.99,0:34:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.53,0:34:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩你和我了 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's just you and me now, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.60,0:35:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的滴滴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that my Uber?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.73,0:35:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.99,0:35:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他 - 带他上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's him. - Let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.39,0:36:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back to the land of the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.27,0:36:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎没留下伤痕 你愈合得真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly a scratch left. You heal fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.39,0:36:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.19,0:36:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,培根 鸡蛋和血肠 吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacon, eggs and black pudding, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.85,0:36:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你需要一顿像样的英式早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you could use a proper English breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.32,0:36:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 在你倒下之前坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, sit down before you fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.50,0:36:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人和一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man with a van.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.11,0:36:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, four men.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.01,0:36:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一下 你欠我三百镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me 300 quid, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.05,0:36:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.50,0:36:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「提防闪电巨龙 我的孩子」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.33,0:36:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「口能撕咬」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The jaws that bite, "
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.13,0:36:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「爪能扼杀」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the claws that catch!"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「提防啾啾怪鸟」 - 「啾啾怪鸟」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Beware the Jubjub bird, " - "The Jubjub bird…"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.10,0:36:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「躲避那狂暴的」 - 「狂暴的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "and shun the frumious…" - "The frumious…"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.64,0:36:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「凶恶猛兽」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bandersnatch!"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.60,0:36:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小爱丽丝·莫纳汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Alice Monaghan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.20,0:37:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么小的爱丽丝·莫纳汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so little Alice Monaghan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.67,0:37:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是干这个吗 用茶叶占卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you do now, huh? You what, you read tea leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.76,0:37:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给别人算命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, you tell people's fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.26,0:37:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在利用与生俱来的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make use of the gifts I was given.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.09,0:37:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你帮人们和死去的亲戚交流吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? You let folks talk to their dead relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.82,0:37:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么收费 五块钱一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what, like five bucks a pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.36,0:37:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多十块吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a tenner.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.32,0:37:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,少撕了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.07,0:37:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得避开烧焦的部分吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to eat around the burnt bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.44,0:37:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lucky for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.51,0:37:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}占卜\N手相解读 10英镑\N灵命解读 20英镑\N塔罗牌 30英镑\N水晶球解读 30英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.71,0:37:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是死者帮忙 我根本找不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for the dead, I never would've found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.22,0:37:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直絮絮叨叨 特别是妈妈和爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They keep blathering on. Especially Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.81,0:37:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 他们向你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say hi, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.34,0:37:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}爸爸 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.48,0:37:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.46,0:37:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可能知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.70,0:37:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有那么一点点在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if you'd given a flying fig.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.05,0:38:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的二十年里能联系我一次的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and checked in on me once in the past 20…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.08,0:38:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没有 我来处理就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he doesn't. Just let me deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.01,0:38:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多死者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}More dead people?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.15,0:38:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过 他们从不闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, they never shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.53,0:38:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在在跟你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they telling you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.17,0:38:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我应该抓住机会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're saying I should kill you while I have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.91,0:38:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 他们知道你不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, they know what you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.59,0:38:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如桌子下面有一把霰弹枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've got a shotgun under the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.48,0:38:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,填装了天使之骨的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}loaded with angel bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.64,0:38:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,正瞄准你的裆部\N{\fnArial\fs30}aimed right at your todger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.50,0:38:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头似乎大家都想要我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like everybody wants me dead nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.63,0:38:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉你为什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They give you a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.55,0:38:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只说了末日即将降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only that the end is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.78,0:38:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且让末日降临的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it'll be you that brings it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.92,0:38:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谷歌翻译一下 可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Google-translate that, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.01,0:38:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是几句…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just something that…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.59,0:38:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友告诉我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}a friend told me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.94,0:38:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.68,0:38:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.57,0:39:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底开不开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna shoot me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者可能会害怕你这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead might be afraid of your demon ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.53,0:39:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我更了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.31,0:39:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 我还欠你一个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I still owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.96,0:39:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我小时候救过我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}for saving my life when I was just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.91,0:39:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们到桌子底下干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.50,0:39:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲开玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avoiding the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.37,0:39:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed police!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.70,0:39:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.24,0:39:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.73,0:39:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.18,0:39:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不明白你为什么这么生我的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know why you were so angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.78,0:39:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能敲门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have knocked?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.03,0:39:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你了 我们清理完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I told you, after we cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.67,0:39:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和巨人战斗留下的一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mess you left behind with the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.59,0:40:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不在现场 我担心你遭遇了不测\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you weren't there, I feared the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.51,0:40:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地你没事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you're all right. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.87,0:40:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道比背后挨刀更让人受伤的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what hurts worse than being stabbed in the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.19,0:40:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是背后挨刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being stabbed in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.16,0:40:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 你不能相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You can't possibly believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.60,0:40:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早知道俄赛里斯会社密谋要暗杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I knew the Osiris Club was plotting to assassinate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.48,0:40:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能相信什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I can't believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能相信你那么多年前为了杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you showed up on Nazi island.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.07,0:40:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在纳粹人的岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those years ago just to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.83,0:40:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.09,0:40:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰见了你的老情人 哈顿夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bumped into your old flame, Lady Hatton.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.82,0:40:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她给我补充了一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh, filled me in on a couple of.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.89,0:40:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家庭故事中的遗漏之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}the missing pieces of our family narrative.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.04,0:40:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想挖我的陈年旧事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you wanna dig up my sordid skeletons,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.02,0:40:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会第一个坦诚相告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be the first to hand you a shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.01,0:40:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is not the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.86,0:40:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我想介绍你认识一个人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's someone I wanna introduce you to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.37,0:40:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,本·戴米奥少校 十一军特种部队队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major Ben Daimio, head of Special Ops for M-11.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.14,0:40:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十一军 - 这是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- M-11? - My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.36,0:40:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们在战后就解散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you guys disbanded after the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.53,0:40:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought we were supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.63,0:40:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,打击怪物 而不是与怪物共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting monsters, not working with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.40,0:40:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管谁叫怪物呢 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you calling monster, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.55,0:40:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近照镜子了吗 疤面煞星\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look in the mirror recently, Scarface?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.16,0:40:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是在玩幽默吗 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that meant to be humor? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.65,0:40:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心理医生确实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My therapist does say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.93,0:40:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依靠笑话寻求正常化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rely on jokes as a way to normalize.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.30,0:40:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常化 是的 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normalize, right. Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.92,0:41:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你们俩相处融洽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So glad to see you two are getting along.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.35,0:41:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是在英国领土 所以这是一次联合行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since this is on British soil, it'll be a joint operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.24,0:41:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我不用任何帮助就能把俄赛里斯会社\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I don't need any help kicking the dentures.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.00,0:41:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得满地找牙好吗 我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the Osiris Club, all right? I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.69,0:41:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这比你了解的还要严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is bigger than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.22,0:41:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣赛巴斯蒂安修道院遭到袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Sebastian's has been attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.61,0:41:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件古物被盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a relic was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.65,0:41:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,据称是妮缪之棺的其中一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought to be one of the Nimue Caskets.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.99,0:41:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nim-who?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.91,0:41:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,薇薇安·妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vivienne Nimue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.67,0:41:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也被称为血皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also known as the Blood Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.73,0:41:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,公元五世纪的一位永生不死的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}An immortal fifth century sorceress.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.09,0:41:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的其中一项能力就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amongst her powers, she has a plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.72,0:41:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点毁灭英国的瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}that almost wiped Britain off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.27,0:41:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这一次可能毁灭全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this time it could be the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.97,0:41:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟王亲自收拾了那个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Arthur himself took care of that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.50,0:41:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用王者之剑肢解了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used Excalibur to dismember her,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.19,0:41:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把尸块锁在了棺材中\N{\fnArial\fs30}then locked the pieces in caskets.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.16,0:41:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将棺材藏在了全国的各个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hid them throughout the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.81,0:41:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,刮目相看 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.16,0:41:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄赛里斯会社在三十年代发现了其中一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Osiris Club discovered one in the '30s.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.31,0:41:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它作为他们的永久收藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kept it as part of their permanent collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.09,0:41:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 那我们回俄赛里斯会社\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. So we go back to the Osiris Club,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.03,0:41:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到这个棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}we find this casket,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.18,0:41:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚到底是谁想把血皇后的碎尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we figure out whoever's trying to Humpty Dumpty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.33,0:41:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新拼起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}this Blood Queen back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.71,0:41:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便对会社进行报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we get a little payback while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.48,0:41:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,报复 这不是为了复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payback? This isn't about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.20,0:41:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.27,0:41:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦棺材安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the casket is secure,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.41,0:41:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要乘第一班飞机离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be on the first flight out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.76,0:42:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,防御局可以把你关回你的回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bureau can put you back in your cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.76,0:42:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的笼子 我的笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cage? My cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.48,0:42:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会特别要求你来打扫我的锯角屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna ask specifically that you clean my sawdust.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.56,0:42:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不及看你闻恶魔的屎了 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait till you smell demon shit, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.81,0:42:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我你是负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me you're the man in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.32,0:42:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 索赔你们造成的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - A bill for damages.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.40,0:42:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}破坏索赔\N一百万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.12,0:42:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百万英镑 就为几扇打破的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}A million pounds? For a few broken windows?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.15,0:42:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得考虑到造成的情感创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta factor in the emotional trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.22,0:42:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你是谁来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, who are you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.42,0:42:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是救了地狱男爵的女孩 你又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the girl who saved Hellboy. Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.29,0:42:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 对了 我想谢谢你救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wanted to thank you for that, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.91,0:42:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她是你的保镖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, she's what, your bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得没错 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking right I am. So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.36,0:42:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是军事行动 不是狂欢节的助兴节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a military operation! Not a carnival sideshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.21,0:42:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝是我唯一信任的人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice is the only person that I trust, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.43,0:42:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你想让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want me,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.55,0:42:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就得跟着一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}she comes with.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.30,0:42:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.36,0:42:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.42,0:42:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.09,0:42:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back to HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.40,0:42:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想办法定位血皇后的其余尸块\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try to locate the rest of the Blood Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.43,0:42:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.40,0:43:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 这女孩怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor. What about the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.35,0:43:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 她是个强大的灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice? She's a powerful spirit medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.03,0:43:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上她一起 我们需要所有的帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her with you. We need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.31,0:43:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这里完事了 我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're done here! Let's move it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.68,0:43:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不打算打开看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you gonna open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.04,0:43:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mega.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.05,0:43:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大概是在过度补偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably overcompensating.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.52,0:43:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他不是我亲爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he's not my real dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.71,0:43:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个礼物不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some present.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.29,0:43:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些爸爸给孩子买乐高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some dads get their kids LEGOs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.80,0:44:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.05,0:44:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.77,0:44:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,通灵偏头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychic migraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.50,0:44:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是我大脑里发生了车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a car crash in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.10,0:44:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生了可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something terrible happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.06,0:44:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里 不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.21,0:44:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.50,0:44:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停 按我的指令行动 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold. Move on my command. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.15,0:44:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能进去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.61,0:44:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 救救他 你们没听见他在尖叫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For fuck's sake, help him! Can't you hear him screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.73,0:44:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.10,0:45:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.17,0:45:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哈顿夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Lady Hatton.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.99,0:45:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前告诉我们的那个灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The psychic you were telling us about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.10,0:45:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 她这个灵媒不够灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, she wasn't psychic enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.38,0:45:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 有什么感应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, picking up anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.16,0:45:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的灵魂还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her spirit's still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.81,0:45:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能和她交流吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can make contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.73,0:46:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚这里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure out what the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.59,0:46:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该离开 少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna leave, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.15,0:46:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事可算不上愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kind of thing isn't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.62,0:46:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,错过所有的乐趣吗 绝对不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And miss all the fun? Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.12,0:46:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈顿夫人 你能听到我的声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Hatton, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.54,0:46:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈顿夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Hatton…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.84,0:46:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.70,0:46:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪 她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue, she has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.33,0:46:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这个我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.38,0:46:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是俄赛里斯会社想杀我的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why Osiris tried to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.15,0:46:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类会堕入她的黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man will fall to her darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.45,0:46:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who call the shadows home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.22,0:46:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,将再度崛起\N{\fnArial\fs30}will rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.17,0:47:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.06,0:47:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要更具体更切实的预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd appreciate a prophecy with smaller and more relatable stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.73,0:47:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能让皇后找到国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Queen must never find a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.18,0:47:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当妮缪再次完整之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Nimue is whole again,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.71,0:47:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真正的命运就将揭晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}then your true destiny will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.67,0:47:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我所见到的 只有到那时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This I have seen. Only then will…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.51,0:47:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有到那时会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only then will what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.74,0:47:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正说到精彩的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just getting to the good part!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.51,0:47:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It's still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.98,0:47:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.46,0:47:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人刚从我嘴里钻出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lady just came out of my fucking mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.53,0:47:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你陪着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.43,0:47:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.29,0:47:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.57,0:47:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是条胳膊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.77,0:48:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快他妈放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.06,0:48:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.67,0:48:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈难道没教过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't your mother ever tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.80,0:48:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要跟死物打交道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shouldn't play with dead things!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.63,0:48:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后陛下 救救我 我还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Queen, help me! I'm not ready yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.79,0:48:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.60,0:48:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.59,0:48:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过像你这样的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never have I seen a creature quite like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.90,0:48:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.70,0:48:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此强大的力量 如此辉煌的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such power, such glorious potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.85,0:48:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有理由成为敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no reason for us to be enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.20,0:48:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.15,0:48:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,成就更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.03,0:48:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们害怕我们 他们称我们为怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fear us. They call us monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.15,0:48:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们渴望着同一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We yearn for the same day,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.04,0:48:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一天我们不再被辱骂 而是被称颂为英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we are not reviled but lauded as heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.57,0:48:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一粒粒种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seed by seed,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.79,0:48:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一棵棵树木 一块块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}tree by tree, stone by stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.02,0:48:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将一起重新种植伊甸园\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll replant Eden together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.35,0:48:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens next,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.33,0:49:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有命运才能决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}only the fates decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.70,0:49:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.18,0:49:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking prick!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.88,0:49:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没打中 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.16,0:49:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你抓住那个混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.72,0:49:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追了 那个该死的跑得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pursued. The damn thing was just too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.78,0:49:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连它的真面目都没看清\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't even get a proper look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.28,0:49:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个丑陋的猪脸贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ugly pig-faced son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.43,0:49:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你看到了 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.70,0:49:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.94,0:49:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我强烈建议你现在就交待\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I strongly suggest you start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.60,0:49:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是棕精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the Gruagach.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.71,0:49:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The what? - Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.63,0:49:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我绝不会忘记那么一张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'd never forget a face like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.18,0:49:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,棕精灵是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a Gruagach?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.96,0:50:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们多年前曾经有一面之缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We first crossed paths years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.60,0:50:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝当时还是个婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice was just a baby at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.26,0:50:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而精灵喜欢偷婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fairies loved to steal babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.12,0:50:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们简直像是活在一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like living in a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.27,0:50:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远醒不来的噩梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't wake up from.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.57,0:50:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows why,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.44,0:50:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是当他们设法偷到一个孩子后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when they do manage to get their hands on one,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.18,0:50:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会留下一个换生灵来冒充人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}they leave a changeling in its place to pass for human.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.89,0:50:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看上去是一样的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks the same, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.29,0:50:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解释不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.94,0:50:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.28,0:50:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.65,0:50:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 你真是最可爱的小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, aren't you the cutest little baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.18,0:50:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妈妈和爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom and your dad are, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.29,0:50:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心你最近举止有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, worried that you've been acting strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.37,0:50:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 地狱男爵叔叔来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Uncle Hellboy is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.32,0:50:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正好有个绝招\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's got just the thing for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.23,0:51:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也是这么想的 你这个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I thought, you little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.46,0:51:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.11,0:51:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁 他们讨厌铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron. They hate the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.91,0:51:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.57,0:51:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 这是虐待儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go! Ahh! This is child abuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.94,0:51:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个小宝宝 你这大个子混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little baby, you big fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.62,0:51:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's disgusting! What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.85,0:51:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't get!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.24,0:51:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.49,0:51:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼 疼 我保证 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts! It hurts! I promise! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.35,0:51:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵会把她送回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fairies will return her!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.77,0:51:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 快他妈放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear! Just fucking let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.31,0:51:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'd love to take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.39,0:51:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.87,0:51:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个问题 那就是我不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one problem, I'm just not stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.81,0:51:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twat!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.46,0:51:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个狡诈的小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You slippery little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.95,0:51:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.50,0:51:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好赶紧把他们的孩子送回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better bring these people back their baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.13,0:51:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就亲自去接她\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm coming to get her myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.16,0:51:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你和你的精灵小伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you and your fairy friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.33,0:51:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有得后悔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are gonna be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.98,0:52:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}爱丽丝镜中世界奇遇记\N刘易斯·卡罗尔
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.64,0:52:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About goddamn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.95,0:52:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.52,0:52:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. She's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.56,0:52:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是新换的尿布\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be a clean diaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.79,0:52:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我会去找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm coming after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.62,0:52:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小爱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wee Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.43,0:52:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能永远躲着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I couldn't avoid him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.45,0:52:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运总是有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny always has a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.79,0:52:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让事情回到原点\N{\fnArial\fs30}of bringing things full circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.41,0:52:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.11,0:52:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是「巧合」的愚蠢解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid word for "coincidence."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.87,0:52:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说命运的坏话 她是个有仇必报的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk shit about fate. She's a vindictive bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.29,0:52:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们背负着我们血统中的每一个罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We carry every sin committed in our bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.19,0:52:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,血皇后也是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood Queen said pretty much the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.24,0:52:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's what this is all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.19,0:52:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前惹过什么精灵之类的蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some fairy tale wanker you pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.70,0:52:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来找你寻仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is now looking for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.20,0:52:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他正在利用血皇后来达成目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's now using the Blood Queen to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.18,0:52:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不好 或许是她在利用他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that. Maybe she's using him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.93,0:52:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.92,0:52:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫亚瑟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Arthur comes along,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.19,0:52:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她砍碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}chops her up into little pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.77,0:52:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,装在箱子里埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}buries her in boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:53:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她只是想让怪物们走出阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she just wants monsters to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.21,0:53:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新生活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the shadows and live again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.14,0:53:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 这样她就又有灭绝人类的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, so she gets another shot at wiping out mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.29,0:53:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不了解她 至少不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that about her. Not for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.13,0:53:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合我们的人 我要带他们回伦敦总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collect our men. I'm taking them back to London HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.83,0:53:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜晚 秘密的忠实守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}O night, faithful preserver of mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.91,0:53:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有明亮的星辰与月亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ye bright stars and moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.94,0:53:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,继承了仇恨之日的火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Succeed the fires of hateful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.34,0:53:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 你们这些渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, you slags!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.17,0:53:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起1500年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pain is fleeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.16,0:53:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,被囚于箱子的折磨 这痛苦不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}compared to 1, 500 years locked in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.18,0:53:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活着只是为了服侍您 皇后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only live to serve, my Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.65,0:53:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你服侍我的唯一目的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only serve to get your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.50,0:54:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,向地狱男爵复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}against this Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.87,0:54:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你来说为何如此重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he so important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用铁烙伤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He burnt me with iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.74,0:54:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒我永世蒙受耻辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cursed me to a world of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.21,0:54:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以做个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've been a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.16,0:54:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是这种可悲徘徊的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this wasted, wandering thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.35,0:54:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以享受真正的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've had a real life,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.35,0:54:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了光明和幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}filled with light and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.73,0:54:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵剥夺了这个权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy stole that from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.16,0:54:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.30,0:54:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇的欲望令我们被愤怒蒙蔽了双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lust for vengeance has made us both blind with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.88,0:54:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪 女巫皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue, Queen of Witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.20,0:54:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue who lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.87,0:54:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪永生不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue, who can never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.15,0:54:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.60,0:54:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到面前出现了一条新的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a new path laid out before me,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.04,0:54:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条通向更大荣耀的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}one that would lead to far greater glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.01,0:55:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的地狱男爵是关键 - 地狱男爵 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And your Hellboy is the key. - Hellboy? But…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.09,0:55:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是要做什么 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going with this? I don't… I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.37,0:55:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.73,0:55:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.10,0:55:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须完成一个最终任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must complete one final task.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.73,0:55:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 炸鱼薯条店 - 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fish 'n chips shop? - We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.00,0:55:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}鳕鱼冲击\N炸鱼薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.89,0:55:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.89,0:55:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望会有个标志写着「秘密总部」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you expecting a sign that says "Secret Headquarters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.81,0:55:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.58,0:55:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Harker.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.42,0:55:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.87,0:55:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为外面就够难闻了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it smelled bad on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.48,0:55:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来交给你们两个吧 我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you two take it from here. I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.61,0:55:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 哪也不许去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.60,0:55:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最不需要的就是一个怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing I need is some freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.61,0:55:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在附近闲晃吓到当地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}wandering around scaring the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.77,0:55:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.90,0:55:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是要拯救世界吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we got to be saving the world or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.37,0:55:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.37,0:56:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.34,0:56:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看证件 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some ID, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.33,0:56:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.56,0:56:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕规矩就是规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rules are rules, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.74,0:56:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在炼狱和地狱我都去过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've been to purgatory and hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.91,0:56:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个老防空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an old bomb shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.13,0:56:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,战后重新翻修的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was refurbished after the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.03,0:56:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻修 你管这个叫翻修吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refurbished? You call this refurbished?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.31,0:56:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.00,0:56:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们目前掌握的有关妮缪的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all we got on Nimue so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.66,0:56:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事 感谢你的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine. Thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.69,0:56:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在俄赛里斯会社的朋友可就不太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends at Osiris, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.73,0:56:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个故事都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No two stories are alike,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.23,0:56:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切似乎都表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everything seems to suggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.05,0:56:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非她完全复原\N{\fnArial\fs30}she won't get her full powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.72,0:56:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则她无法获得全部的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}until she's completely restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.09,0:56:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见了吗 你的朋友都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear me? All your friends are dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there'll be a lot more dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.48,0:56:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会有更多人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we don't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.10,0:56:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以或许你们俩可以看看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}So perhaps you two would like to grab a book,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.80,0:56:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}do some research,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.89,0:56:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,想办法找出她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe find out where she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.04,0:56:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就能在她灭了我们之前灭了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can bury her before she buries us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.35,0:57:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好 有作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.56,0:57:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得戴米奥溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder Daimio took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.42,0:57:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}枪炮匠
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.57,0:57:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴米奥探员 十一军 货备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Daimio, M-11. Is the package ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.39,0:57:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.89,0:57:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这能管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure this is going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.36,0:57:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有很多人试过杀他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people have tried to kill him already.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.22,0:57:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没用过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with something like this they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.16,0:57:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是用犹大的银币\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cast from Judas Silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.17,0:57:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,混合圣多米尼克的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}mixed with the blood of Saint Dominic,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.90,0:57:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,并受过圣父祝福的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}blessed by the Holy Father himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.01,0:57:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 一定管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will work, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.12,0:57:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设你真的用得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming you've actually got to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.09,0:57:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 谁能说这家伙不诚实呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who's to say this bloke's not on the level?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.07,0:57:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我当兵前是做什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I did before joining the service?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.77,0:57:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险精算师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was an actuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.30,0:57:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根据一系列\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assessed risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.63,0:57:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,复杂的数学方程式来评估风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}based on a series of complex mathematical equations.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.41,0:57:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 人会说谎 但数字不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, people lie, but numbers don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.42,0:57:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 地狱男爵有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from where I stand, Hellboy doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.52,0:57:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他体内的怪物是无法否认的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monster inside him cannot be denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.94,0:58:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是针对个人 只是数学而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not personal, it's just maths.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.34,0:58:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没错 不能让他活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, can't see letting him live.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.27,0:58:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保一击致命 要么心脏要么大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure it's a kill shot. Either the heart or the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.63,0:58:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就心脏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.50,0:58:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵的大脑太小难以瞄准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy's brain is too small a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.40,0:58:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书上怎么这么多字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does this book have so many words?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.44,0:58:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设我们找到妮缪了 假设找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say we find Nimue, huh? Let's say we find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.06,0:58:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.99,0:58:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用正义的愤怒和强力的拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, with a righteous fury and a mighty fist,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.52,0:58:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,将她打倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll smite her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.10,0:58:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 拜托 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on, Hellboy,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.45,0:58:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的脚从丘吉尔的桌子上拿下来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}take your feet off Churchill's desk, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.60,0:58:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}温斯顿·丘吉尔爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.58,0:58:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.49,0:58:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.81,0:58:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后确保她死透 不会卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we make sure she doesn't come back for the sequel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.54,0:58:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.58,0:58:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后世界会照常运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the world will keep on spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.93,0:58:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以再喝杯茶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll have another cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.61,0:58:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.28,0:58:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.86,0:58:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.84,0:58:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答问题就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.30,0:58:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.67,0:59:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找下一个敌人 这是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we fight our next foe. It's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.39,0:59:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢 - 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then what? - Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.29,0:59:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then… what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.04,0:59:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有话要说 就说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something to say, say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.94,0:59:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的道德高地是建立在一堆狗屎上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your moral high ground is founded on a pile of bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.79,0:59:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是超自然调查防御局\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the B.P.R.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.04,0:59:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是{\u1}沙子上的线{\u0}{\fs14}[底线]{\fs}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the line in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.49,0:59:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙子就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the thing about sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.61,0:59:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以再画一条线\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can always draw another line.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.74,0:59:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位 - 要不是有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys! - If we weren't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.04,0:59:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里早就变成撒旦的度假屋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this would be Satan's holiday home.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.55,0:59:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是人类不那么热衷于\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe if humans weren't so keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.75,0:59:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀女巫和恶魔之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on killing witches and demons and such,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.30,0:59:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫和魔鬼之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the witches and demons and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.69,0:59:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会那么热衷于杀人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't be so keen on killing humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.83,0:59:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是胡搅蛮缠 你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a false equivalence and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.68,0:59:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.50,0:59:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们面临的每一个威胁的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer to every threat we face.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.51,0:59:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}cannot be annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.48,0:59:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定存在一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a world where monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.97,0:59:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用躲在阴影里的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't have to hide in the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.79,0:59:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不必生活在恐惧之中 怪物可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they don't have to live in fear. Where monsters…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.43,0:59:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她影响到你了吗 妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has she got to you? Nimue,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.16,0:59:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用花言巧语和挺拔的胸部\N{\fnArial\fs30}she got to you with her perfumed words.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.69,0:59:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,打动你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her perky breasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.89,0:59:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.28,1:00:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在说她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even talking about her!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.22,1:00:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是在说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.52,1:00:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们面临世上所有的神秘和超自然威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We face every mystical and metaphysical threat there is,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.78,1:00:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是收养了我 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet you take me in. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.17,1:00:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被派去杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were sent to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.86,1:00:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么改变了你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.60,1:00:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.80,1:00:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,十岁生日你送了我一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me a gun on my tenth birthday!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.25,1:00:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派我去威尔顿根森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me into the Wildungen forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.99,1:00:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,狩猎一群野山巨怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hunt a pack of wild hill trolls!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.83,1:00:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.35,1:00:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们没玩过蛇梯棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we didn't play Snakes and Ladders.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.04,1:00:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没玩过钓鱼游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't play Go Fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.53,1:00:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没教过你踢足球或打棒球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't coach you in football or baseball.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.39,1:00:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我变成了该死的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me a goddamn weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.30,1:00:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮助你成为最好的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to help you become the best you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.41,1:00:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you, uh, loved me,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.78,1:00:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你早该和你那些想置我于死地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you could talk to some of your human friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.49,1:00:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类朋友谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would want to see me dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.39,1:00:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than unleashing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.76,1:01:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀我的兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}to slaughter my brothers and sisters!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.13,1:01:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.63,1:01:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,教养有方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just solid parenting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.64,1:01:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.44,1:01:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.90,1:01:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.60,1:01:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我按的上楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pushed up!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.91,1:01:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.77,1:01:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上楼 - 下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up! - Going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.98,1:01:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.35,1:01:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上楼 上楼 上楼 - 下楼 下楼 下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up! Up! Up! Up! - Down. Down. Down. Down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.50,1:01:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下楼 下楼 下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down. Down. Down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.96,1:01:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.42,1:02:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下一层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.78,1:02:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅佳婆婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baba Yaga.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.50,1:03:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆 雅佳婆婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baba? Baba Yaga!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.09,1:03:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.20,1:03:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.71,1:03:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you summon me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.80,1:03:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩游戏是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play games, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.82,1:03:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 我们来玩骰子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, let's break out the Yahtzee.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.92,1:03:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它的我不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.84,1:04:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到了你的饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt your hunger,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.21,1:04:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你准备了盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have prepared a feast for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.84,1:04:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you look lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.85,1:04:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人认为我丑陋无比 独眼的老巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most think me grotesque. An old hag with one eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.37,1:04:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.16,1:04:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是你让我变成这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably because you did this to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.40,1:04:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你试图把斯大林的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recall you trying to raise.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.94,1:05:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂从墓地里召唤出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stalin's ghost from the Necropolis.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.35,1:05:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得做点什么来阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to do something to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.61,1:05:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你打瞎我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you shot out my eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.72,1:05:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我关进这个监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put me in this prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.31,1:05:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得把你放逐到邻近的空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I thought that banishing you to an adjacent dimension was,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.60,1:05:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}kinda clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.13,1:05:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.76,1:05:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.49,1:05:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对两个人来说 真是桌宴席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Quite a spread for just two people.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.17,1:05:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们庆祝她的归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We celebrate her return.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.58,1:05:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.14,1:05:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为她的正义喝彩是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are correct to applaud her righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.77,1:05:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她的世界里 你会被奉为英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her world, you will be hailed a hero!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.50,1:05:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会为你建造两千英尺高的雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will build statues of you, 2, 000 feet high!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.24,1:05:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你敌人的骨头打造而成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made from the bones of your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.12,1:06:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那需要一大堆骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd take a shit-ton of bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.86,1:06:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.25,1:06:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个小孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a child?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.37,1:06:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的小孩而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a human child.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.29,1:06:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.36,1:06:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.72,1:06:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨手笨脚 不好意思 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So clumsy. Sorry about that. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.10,1:06:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,得去复活现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be there for that resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.13,1:06:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定比披头士还带劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna be better than The Beatles!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.46,1:06:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.69,1:06:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.69,1:07:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道妮缪在哪儿 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where Nimue is, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.27,1:07:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,多漂亮的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such nice eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.21,1:07:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟尿一样黄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow as piss.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.84,1:07:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite color.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.56,1:07:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一个来代替你从我这夺走的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want one to replace what you took from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.21,1:07:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的 姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen, sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.62,1:07:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时间不多了 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time is running out, demon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.21,1:07:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦妮缪完成复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once Nimue's resurrection is complete,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.16,1:07:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的瘟疫会剥去人们身体上的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}her plague will strip the flesh from bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.22,1:07:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine, take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.75,1:07:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,先告诉我去哪找妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me where to find Nimue first.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.37,1:07:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一项神圣的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a sacred bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.64,1:07:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦达成 就不能打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once made, it cannot be broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.03,1:07:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你想要书面的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you want it in writing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.07,1:07:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.93,1:07:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用吻达成交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's seal it with a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.20,1:07:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的舌头上怎么有毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you have hair on your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.11,1:08:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去彭德尔山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Pendle Hill.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.68,1:08:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要回收她的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will need to reclaim her blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.10,1:08:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能恢复她的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to restore her power.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.95,1:08:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在午夜前赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only have until midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.73,1:08:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一只好呢 右眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which shall it be, the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.99,1:08:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是左眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the left?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.69,1:08:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这会非常疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this will hurt a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.96,1:08:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你发过誓的 - 你会得到你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You swore! - You'll get your eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.90,1:08:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我用完就给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as I'm done with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.96,1:08:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没明确时间范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never specified a time frame.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.20,1:08:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说得更具体些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've been more specific.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.91,1:08:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在吃小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been eating children!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.81,1:08:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.39,1:09:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚 带走你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Take your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.38,1:09:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续用一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have them for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.91,1:09:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你骗我 我要诅咒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But cheat me and here's my curse,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.57,1:09:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有两只眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.41,1:09:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来看你在这世上最爱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see the thing you love most in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.61,1:09:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦地死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}suffer and die!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.68,1:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不打算用门了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you just not using doors anymore?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.25,1:09:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吊我们胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't keep us in suspense.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.42,1:09:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚去见雅佳婆婆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a visit from Baba Yaga.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.57,1:09:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,血皇后在彭德尔山\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Blood Queen's in Pendle Hill.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.02,1:09:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你理顺了轻重缓急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to see you've straightened your priorities out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.82,1:09:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不听你的命令 老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not taking orders from you, old man!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.01,1:10:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在沙子上画我自己的线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just drawing my own line in the sand!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.39,1:10:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来帮我拿个薄荷糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, please, get me a mint!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.64,1:10:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been a long time, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.75,1:10:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太变态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.03,1:10:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们在彭德尔山对那些女巫做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what they did to the witches at Pendle Hill?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.89,1:10:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们割掉她们的舌头 拿去喂蛆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut off their tongues, fed them to maggots.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.57,1:10:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后当场把她们活埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and buried them alive right there on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.15,1:10:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信你在网上看到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe everything you read on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.00,1:10:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说错什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.21,1:10:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除世界上的邪恶是脏活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ridding the world of evil is a dirty business.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.34,1:10:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和怪物到底有什么渊源\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with you and monsters, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.54,1:11:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候有怪物非礼过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them touch you funny as a kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.33,1:11:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子见过太多变态的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been seeing freaky shit my whole life,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.45,1:11:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说教会了我什么的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it's taught me anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.23,1:11:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是仇恨隐藏在最正直的面孔之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's that hate hides behind the most righteous faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.59,1:11:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要跟我讲面孔的事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seriously gonna lecture me about faces?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.78,1:11:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你认为这些伤疤是我刮胡子弄出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you think I got these scars from shaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.04,1:11:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么 我会一直问下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? I'm not gonna stop asking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.54,1:11:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不如直接告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might as well tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.83,1:11:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我的部队在伯利兹进行训练演习\N{\fnArial\fs30}My unit was on a training exercise in Belize.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.07,1:11:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地的一个部落长老来找我们求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the local tribal elders came to us asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.77,1:11:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的村庄遭到一个食人兽的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their village was under attack by a man-eater.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.11,1:11:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会在晚上出现 抓走它的猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would come at night, carry off its prey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.05,1:11:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是男人 但有时是妇女和儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly men, but sometimes it was women and children, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.31,1:11:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮 聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savage. Smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.42,1:11:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无悔意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally without remorse.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.79,1:11:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们狩猎它的过程中\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the while that we were hunting it,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.28,1:12:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是它在狩猎我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}in reality, it was hunting us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.87,1:12:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.65,1:12:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.04,1:12:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接近目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming up on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.56,1:12:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能在那座山上着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we can land on that hill.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.68,1:12:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽可能靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get us up as close as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.57,1:12:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后 给您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.80,1:12:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,您很快就会恢复成原来的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be back to feeling your amazing old self in no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.67,1:12:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命之血支撑着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life blood sustains you…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.31,1:12:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我必须取回属于我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I must reclaim what is mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.28,1:12:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.95,1:12:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地狱男爵呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Hellboy?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.03,1:12:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他来了 我准备了一个小惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he comes, I have a little surprise in store.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.76,1:12:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快到午夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's almost midnight!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.44,1:12:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.69,1:13:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.21,1:13:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是恶魔也不是士兵 我他妈累死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a demon or a soldier. I'm fucking knackered.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.07,1:13:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稍微休息一下 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just give us a sec. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.21,1:13:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.50,1:13:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.38,1:13:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家的死人就不能老实待在地下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't anything in this country stay buried!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.11,1:13:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.63,1:14:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 快到午夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy! It's almost midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.71,1:14:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找血皇后 这里交给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find the Blood Queen. We can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.50,1:14:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不阻止她 她就会释放瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll spread her plague if you don't stop her!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.34,1:14:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.86,1:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 我不会离开你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.90,1:14:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 阻止妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Stop Nimue!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.88,1:14:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没子弹了 躲在我身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out. Stay behind me!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.83,1:14:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈还能去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck else am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.38,1:14:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.48,1:14:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.45,1:14:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.88,1:14:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am reborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.84,1:14:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 您气色不错 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're looking good, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.86,1:14:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是城堡的皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the queen of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.46,1:15:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 皇后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here, my Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.27,1:15:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从黑暗中出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've come from out of the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.39,1:15:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆祝您的回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}to celebrate your return.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.96,1:15:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再点头哈腰了 我亲爱的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more bowing and scraping, my beloveds.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.16,1:15:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.52,1:15:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一支大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want an army,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.36,1:15:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,长期隐藏于人类的视线之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}long hidden from the eyes of man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.10,1:15:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要被遗忘的人走出黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the forgotten people out of the dark!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.27,1:15:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些生活在尘土中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who have lived in dust,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.51,1:15:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些啃食干骨头 梦见鲜血的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have gnawed on dry bones while dreaming of blood!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.63,1:15:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我想要的 给我一支这样的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what I want. Give me an army like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.55,1:15:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会让白天的世界哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will make the daytime world weep!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.72,1:16:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要像老鼠一样蜷缩在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't just cower there like mice.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.83,1:16:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,上前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step forth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.40,1:16:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.72,1:16:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真好 藏了那么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}How kind of you to grace me with your presence.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.34,1:16:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在过来捧场\N{\fnArial\fs30}after hiding all these years.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.73,1:16:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求您 妮缪 仁慈对待我和姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Nimue, for me and my sisters, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.15,1:16:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈内达 你对我仁慈过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ganeida, did you show me mercy?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.71,1:16:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当亚瑟把我砍碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Arthur cut me to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.19,1:16:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,活埋我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and buried me alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.38,1:16:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的仁慈在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where was your mercy then?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.96,1:16:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 求求您 - 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't, I beg you! - Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.78,1:16:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,像动物一样卑躬屈膝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Groveling like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.09,1:16:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 戈内达 我不会杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Ganeida, I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.52,1:16:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须先为我做件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must do something for me first.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.11,1:16:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来证明你新发现的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prove your newfound loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.79,1:16:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,带地狱男爵去见那个能指引他命运的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Hellboy to the one who can show him his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.83,1:17:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我打断你们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry! Did I interrupt?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.04,1:17:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.92,1:17:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我没迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm not late to the party!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.04,1:17:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来得正是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've arrived just in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.50,1:17:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,数量太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.19,1:17:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off him!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.92,1:17:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.76,1:18:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪儿学来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you learn how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.89,1:18:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 自从我被精灵带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Ever since the fairies took me,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.62,1:18:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能做一些奇怪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been able to do some weird shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.61,1:18:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在我身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.18,1:18:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.83,1:18:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.77,1:18:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么时候该等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know when to wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.04,1:18:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没那么好笑了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fucking funny now, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.55,1:18:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后陛下 恢复我的力量 让我干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Queen, restore me now! Let me finish him!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.19,1:18:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.78,1:18:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你发过誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you swore…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,管好你的舌头 猪头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your tongue, pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.43,1:18:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.58,1:18:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.99,1:18:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.85,1:18:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去孕育一个新的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}To give birth to a new world!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.68,1:18:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 通过杀害许多无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, by killing a lot of innocent people!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.41,1:18:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要为那些憎恨和恐惧你的人而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you fight for those who hate and fear you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.91,1:18:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你之前 我只想要复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanted was revenge, until I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.96,1:18:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以迎来世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can usher in the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.40,1:18:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰烬中将诞生新的伊甸园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the ashes, a new Eden will emerge.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.51,1:18:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛下这些脆弱可怜的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave these frail, pathetic humans behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.30,1:19:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我的国王 以你的真实身份接受爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my king. And be revered for who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.49,1:19:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们属于彼此 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong together, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.36,1:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此 但是行不通的 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do! But it's not gonna work, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.60,1:19:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是摩羯座 而你是他妈疯子座\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm a Capricorn and you're fucking nuts!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.65,1:19:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的体内沉睡着恶魔 我会唤醒它\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon sleeps inside you, and I will waken it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.96,1:19:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy! Hellboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.68,1:19:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我必须夺走你所爱过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I have to take away everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.49,1:19:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切人事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everyone you've ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.10,1:19:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.45,1:19:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 血皇后恢复了全部力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, the Blood Queen has all her powers now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.66,1:19:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.10,1:19:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只会让它扩散得更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll only make it spread faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.20,1:19:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你三秒钟时间来弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three seconds to make this right!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.18,1:19:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.20,1:19:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.11,1:19:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪的力量太强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue's power is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.13,1:19:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.33,1:19:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧世界有一个人可以帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one who can help you from the Old World.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.84,1:19:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.55,1:20:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真要听她的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not seriously gonna listen to her!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.76,1:20:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能会把我们引入陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be leading us straight into a trap!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.67,1:20:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以救你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can save your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.39,1:20:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.18,1:20:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去黑鳍山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Black Fin.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.81,1:20:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在悬崖顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}High atop the cliffs.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.94,1:20:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,岩石中隐藏着一条古老的牧羊道\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's an old goat path hidden in the rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.27,1:20:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路充满危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way is treacherous,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.11,1:20:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须沿着它走到尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you must follow it until you can go no further.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.94,1:20:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那 你会在山洞中找到通往地球内部的通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, you'll find a passage into the bowels of the Earth, in a cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.61,1:20:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 戴米奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, Daimio.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.82,1:20:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的人就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you seek is there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.37,1:20:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,智者梅林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merlin the Wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.33,1:20:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王的巫师 愚者的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wizard to kings, and king of fools.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.29,1:20:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为允许亚瑟背叛停战协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cursed to live forever buried in a hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.08,1:20:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而被诅咒永远活埋在洞里\N{\fnArial\fs30}for allowing Arthur to betray the truce.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.80,1:20:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于要带走我的灵魂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you finally come to claim my soul?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.18,1:20:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.23,1:20:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我的朋友中毒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! My friend's been poisoned,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.98,1:21:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人告诉我们你能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we were told that you can help!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.78,1:21:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这个 这是妮缪干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen this before. This is Nimue's work.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.91,1:21:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能小瞧这个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot underestimate this witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.87,1:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是邪恶的化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is evil incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.20,1:21:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们迅速行动 还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still a chance if we act quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.00,1:21:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作为回报 你必须答应我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you must promise me something in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.29,1:21:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you will do whatever is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.04,1:21:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to destroy Nimue, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.88,1:21:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈保证做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can damn well guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.21,1:21:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.32,1:21:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用担心那东西要去哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we be worried about where that's going?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.91,1:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.50,1:21:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the new guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.79,1:22:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了你肯定不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe me if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.09,1:22:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.42,1:22:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的朋友休息 他们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let your friends rest. They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.42,1:22:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来发生的事你要独自面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}What comes next is for you and you alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.72,1:22:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 你的故事在我耳边低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy, your story whispered itself into my ear.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到命运对我们两个另有安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I realized fate had something else in store for us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.14,1:22:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.64,1:22:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时代中还有亚瑟王的传说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are there still tales of King Arthur in your time?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.73,1:22:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎样从石头中拔出剑来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How he drew the sword from the stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.92,1:22:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还有电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Movies, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.49,1:22:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个常见的流行文化巨星\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a regular pop culture phenom.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.65,1:22:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.91,1:22:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们以为亚瑟的血统随他而去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People believe that Arthur's lineage died with him,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.24,1:22:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.58,1:22:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟有了一个女儿 那个女儿又有了女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloodline continued when Arthur had a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.66,1:22:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此继续 血统就延续下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that daughter had a daughter, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.96,1:22:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一位是萨拉·贝瑟尼·休斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ending with Sarah Bethany Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.05,1:22:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她曾在一个山羊形状的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to fly to the Sabbath.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.05,1:22:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔的背上飞向安息日\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the back of a demon in the shape of a goat.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.80,1:22:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在1574年的五朔节前夕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on Walpurgis Night, 1574,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.22,1:22:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她嫁给了那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}she married that demon.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.73,1:23:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那天晚上 她被拖下了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That very night she was taken down to hell,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.73,1:23:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那里生下了一个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}where she delivered a son,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.90,1:23:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿努·恩·罗摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anung un Rama.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.15,1:23:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后那部分 我之前听到过 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That last part, I've heard that before. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.70,1:23:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 阿努·恩·罗摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you… Anung un Rama.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.41,1:23:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物毁灭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroyer of all things.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.58,1:23:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出生那天被授予的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The title you were given on the day you were born.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.62,1:23:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我母亲是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my mother was human.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.42,1:23:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是人类 至少一部分是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so are you. At least in part.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.55,1:23:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟之子 王族最后的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Arthur, last of the royal lineage.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.76,1:23:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood of his blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.43,1:23:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,注定要成为人类之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destined to be king of man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.52,1:23:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我知道你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.11,1:23:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一个能做到必要的事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only one who can do what must be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.69,1:23:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,王者之剑 唯一可以对抗妮缪的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excalibur, the one weapon that can stand against Nimue.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.20,1:24:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在动画里看起来比这大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks bigger in the cartoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.66,1:24:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有亚瑟的真正后裔才能挥动它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a true descendant of Arthur can wield it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.83,1:24:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 这是你与生俱来的权力 你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your birthright, Hellboy, your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.26,1:24:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你摧毁血皇后的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how you will destroy the Blood Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.53,1:25:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你答应过我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You gave me your word!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.99,1:25:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁现在还来得及 把剑拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the sword before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.99,1:25:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.08,1:25:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.00,1:25:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.50,1:25:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用最后的魔力把王者之剑带到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used the last of my magic to bring Excalibur here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.13,1:25:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在剑回到了亚瑟身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the sword has returned to Arthur,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.93,1:25:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一配得上它的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only man worthy of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.55,1:25:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以阻止她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've stopped her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.27,1:25:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我不会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I won't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.27,1:25:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着这个世界凋零死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to watch the world wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.79,1:26:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑啊 对 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Yeah, go on, run.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.00,1:26:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些可悲的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pathetic bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.43,1:26:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止 英国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, the British government.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.64,1:26:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有找到这场正以\N{\fnArial\fs30}has failed to pinpoint the origin of the plague.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.10,1:26:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,前所未有的速度蔓延的瘟疫的源头\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is spreading at an unprecedented rate.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.02,1:26:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相已官方宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister has declared.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.35,1:26:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入紧急状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}an official state of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.40,1:26:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,并敦促英国公民留在室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is urging British citizens to remain indoors.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.65,1:26:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免与任何可能被感染的人接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to avoid contact with anyone who may be infected.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.95,1:26:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,预计伤亡人数将在两小时内达到十万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casualties are expected to reach 100, 000 within two hours,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.27,1:26:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}突发新闻\N致命瘟疫爆发
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.68,1:26:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国瘟疫将在未来24小时内\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the British plague spreading to the EU.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.04,1:26:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蔓延至欧盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}resulting in massive fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.04,1:26:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成大量死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the next 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.62,1:26:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,并有可能引发全球疫情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and threatening to spark a global epidemic.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.92,1:26:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.13,1:26:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况已经糟到不能更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shit has gone way beyond the fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.13,1:26:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有个来自五世纪的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there, there's a fifth century sorceress.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.92,1:27:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她的猪怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her pig monster,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.05,1:27:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要毁灭伦敦和整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}who want to bring down the curtain on London and the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.18,1:27:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请告诉我 他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please tell me where the fuck they are!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.15,1:27:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看证件 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see some ID, love.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.91,1:27:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染率远远高于最初…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infection rate is much higher than initially…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.49,1:27:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉我们下面发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell us what happened down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.29,1:27:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘道夫去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Gandalf?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.33,1:27:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 他要把剑给我 王者之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead. He offered me the sword, Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.58,1:27:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说那是杀死血皇后的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was the only way to kill the Blood Queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.34,1:27:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 剑在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.09,1:27:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没拿剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take the sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.96,1:27:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果我拿了 我就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if I do, I'm the guy who's gonna.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.80,1:27:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启世界末日的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring about the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.97,1:27:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那个开启世界末日的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the guy who's going to bring about the end of the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.18,1:27:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,少自大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.60,1:27:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴米奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daimio!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.39,1:27:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有任务要完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.65,1:27:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.44,1:27:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.56,1:27:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,血皇后刚刚攻破了超自然调查防御局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Blood Queen just took out the B.P.R.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.07,1:28:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.01,1:28:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到你爸爸的 他没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find your father. He's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.43,1:28:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I'd know.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.72,1:28:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.14,1:28:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在圣保罗大教堂外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm outside St. Paul's Cathedral,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.72,1:28:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and right over there,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.95,1:28:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}圣保罗大教堂大屠杀
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.98,1:28:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,数百名武装警察继续与一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}hundreds of armed police continue a shootout.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.02,1:28:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份不明的袭击者交火\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an unknown assailant.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.00,1:28:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.60,1:29:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on your side!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.64,1:29:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 我的错 - 十一军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. My bad. - M-11!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.77,1:29:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何情况下都不准进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one enters under any circumstances!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.36,1:29:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.61,1:29:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.82,1:29:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.62,1:29:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉皇后陛下不能亲自来迎接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry my queen couldn't be here to greet you in person.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.66,1:29:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是好兆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.71,1:29:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么变得这么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he get so fucking big?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.33,1:29:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 如你所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellboy, as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.67,1:29:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她确保了你能受到正式的欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's made sure you receive a proper fucking welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.26,1:29:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我等这一刻等了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no idea how long I've been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.60,1:29:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have some idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.14,1:29:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我就是那个让小猪仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was the guy that sent little piggy squealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.43,1:30:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路尖叫着跑回家的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.31,1:30:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.36,1:30:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你的头拧下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll rip your fucking head off!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.33,1:30:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.38,1:30:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猪仔 我带来了你的最爱 铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little piggy, I brought your favorite! Iron!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.42,1:30:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna work this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.18,1:30:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抬不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.35,1:30:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝尝这个 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, you fucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.31,1:30:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, you…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.23,1:30:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的浑蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.87,1:30:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.04,1:31:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会就这么扔下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just gonna leave you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.68,1:31:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.14,1:31:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.40,1:32:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 你的脸就像狒狒的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at ya. You got a face like a baboon's ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.07,1:32:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖躺在那儿流血 让我把你干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now just lay there and bleed while I finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.28,1:32:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.49,1:32:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that, pal!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.00,1:32:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking mutt.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.26,1:32:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴米奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daimio?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.97,1:32:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃烤肉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's eat some barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.27,1:32:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地狱男爵 - 给我这个干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hellboy! - What am I supposed to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.32,1:32:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,即兴发挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Improvise!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.59,1:33:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要砸烂你的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna squash your fucking head now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.22,1:33:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 你个红脸傻逼 - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, you red-faced twat! - Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.31,1:33:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.39,1:33:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过他 我的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go, my pet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.06,1:33:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的 我把你拼齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal. I found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.11,1:33:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是我策划的 我是一切的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I set all this in motion! I was the beginning of it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.53,1:33:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.45,1:33:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 我需要有人挑战地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. I needed someone to challenge Hellboy,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.62,1:33:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他逼到绝境\N{\fnArial\fs30}push him to the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.66,1:33:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你答应过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you promised!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.92,1:33:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应恢复你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make you whole again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.59,1:33:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,无与伦比的强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful beyond compare.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.76,1:33:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在短暂闪耀的时间内\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for one brief, shining moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.30,1:34:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确实实现了 - 这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you were. - This ain't fair!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.26,1:34:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去死 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Hellboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.10,1:34:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你也去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fuck you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.44,1:34:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 该结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, time to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.94,1:34:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.53,1:34:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是敌人 我们被命运连结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not enemies. We are bound together by fate!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.20,1:34:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说这些废话了 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this crap again, lady!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.78,1:34:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些教训值得重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some lessons bear repeating.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.51,1:34:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想有多少人一生都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think how many spent their lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.88,1:34:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找亚瑟的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}searching for Arthur's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.14,1:34:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一直都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been right here all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.07,1:34:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔剑吧 这是你的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. It's yours by right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.53,1:35:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感受到 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can feel it, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.62,1:35:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在呼唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How it calls to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.99,1:35:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,搅动你生命的核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stirring the thing at the core of your being.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.79,1:35:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注定要成为的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing you're destined to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.46,1:35:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔剑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.88,1:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀我 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to kill me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.35,1:35:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔剑 拔剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up the sword. Take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.60,1:35:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.44,1:35:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在耍什么把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what your game is here,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.44,1:35:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm done playing!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.45,1:35:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.04,1:35:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.66,1:35:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.33,1:35:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做你该做的 干掉这个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you have to do and take out this bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.83,1:36:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 妮缪 妮缪 不 放开他 妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Nimue! Nimue, no! Let him go, Nimue!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.38,1:36:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他 你想要的是我 来抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go! It's me you want! Take me!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.88,1:36:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经在我手上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.93,1:36:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是还不知道罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.14,1:36:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.61,1:36:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.57,1:36:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.69,1:36:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你别死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.41,1:36:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.17,1:36:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 伙计 你真是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, mate. You're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.50,1:36:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 至少现在我知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least now I know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.46,1:36:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直表现的像个该死的混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been acting like such a fucking dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.42,1:36:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你立刻振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to pull it together now!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.84,1:36:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.22,1:36:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your tears.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.56,1:36:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起我为全人类准备的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}His death is a mercy compared to.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.27,1:36:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死是一种仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I have in store for the rest of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.86,1:37:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为在你有机会使用王者之剑时\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because you were too cowardly to use Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.90,1:37:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太懦弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.32,1:37:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的两个父亲都会以你为耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both your fathers would be ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.90,1:37:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮缪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nimue!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.57,1:37:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.42,1:37:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.91,1:37:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.67,1:39:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.84,1:39:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你明白了 我们生来就要共同统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see that we were born to rule together.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.35,1:39:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟只是个凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur was just a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.02,1:39:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他手中 王者之剑是死亡的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his hands, Excalibur was an instrument of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.60,1:39:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在你手中 你可以建立新的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in yours, you can build a new world,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.23,1:39:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们的同类建立更美好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}a better world for all our kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.78,1:39:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.31,1:40:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.86,1:40:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你 地狱男爵 你不是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you, Hellboy. You're better than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.70,1:40:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听这个老傻瓜的话 这是你命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to this old fool. You were meant for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.24,1:40:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想利用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to use you,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.08,1:40:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭曲你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}make you into something you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.54,1:40:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别再发牢骚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stop being a whiny little shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.92,1:40:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,向她证明她错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and show her she's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.04,1:40:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇往直前 拥抱你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go forth and embrace your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.09,1:40:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁你的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy your enemies!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.26,1:40:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没完没了地唠叨抱怨命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this bitching and moaning about destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.22,1:41:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,成熟点吧 你是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow a pair! You're a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.18,1:41:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是个好人 做个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a good one! Act like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.85,1:41:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让预言告诉你你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let a prophecy tell you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.52,1:41:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You decide for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.77,1:41:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.82,1:41:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是世界末日的伟大野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the great beast of the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.65,1:41:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是真正的你 一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the real you! It always has been.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.99,1:41:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧尽过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn out the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.37,1:41:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be rid of the weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.92,1:41:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My King.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.02,1:42:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't over!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.69,1:42:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们注定要在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are destined for one another!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.44,1:42:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会再见面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will meet again.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.69,1:42:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界末日的最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the last day of the ending of the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.16,1:42:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 别说了 你还剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, quit while you're…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.28,1:42:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个头 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A head. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.79,1:42:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.13,1:43:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知道 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.51,1:43:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.31,1:43:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体内的这个野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}This beast inside me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.06,1:43:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我内心的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}My inner nature!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.64,1:43:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}My destiny!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.10,1:43:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.19,1:43:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多年前你为什么不杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you kill me all those years ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.86,1:43:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a job,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.61,1:43:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护世界不受怪物的侵害\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect the world from monsters!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.99,1:43:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有为那晚做的决定后悔过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never, ever regretted the decision I made that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.50,1:43:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.54,1:43:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴听我说 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and listen to me. There's things I need to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.67,1:43:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力做我能做到的最好的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to be the best father I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.80,1:43:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道怎么养孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did I know about raising a kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.35,1:43:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个杀手 而且很在行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a killer, and damn good at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.60,1:43:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些野兽罪有应得 有些则不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some beasts deserved it, some didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.22,1:43:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做了我认为必要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did what I believed was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.44,1:43:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我死后有机会变成天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I have any chance of growing wings,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.65,1:43:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.73,1:44:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.32,1:44:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.45,1:44:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这场看似永无止境的战争有结束的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there is ever an end in this seemingly forever war,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.45,1:44:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将是因为你和你强大的右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will be because of you and your strong right hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.67,1:44:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是人类最好的 也是唯一的希望 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are mankind's best and only hope, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.55,1:44:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你别死 我还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please don't go. I'm not ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.47,1:44:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.64,1:44:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你的父亲是我做过的最好的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being your father was the best decision I ever made.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.31,1:44:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.06,1:44:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Hellboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.30,1:45:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.51,1:45:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.89,1:45:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like cats.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.61,1:45:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都更喜欢狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been more of a dog person.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.20,1:45:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 现在你是英格兰国王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're the king of England now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.70,1:45:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 好吧 我真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yup. - Well, I didn't see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.38,1:45:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}六个月后
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.35,1:45:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}西伯利亚
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.43,1:45:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.19,1:46:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人收到吗 有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody copy? Does any…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.69,1:46:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worthless piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.99,1:46:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥尼斯协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Oannes Society.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.00,1:46:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}从太阳神厄里奥皮克兄弟协会中分裂出的团体
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.53,1:46:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让俄赛里斯会社看起来像是童子军\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make Osiris look like Cub Scouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.47,1:46:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 又一个秘密男孩俱乐部吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ! Another secret boys club?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.33,1:46:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群疯子 他们在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of lunatics. What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.29,1:46:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的后援呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's our back-up?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.42,1:46:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.71,1:46:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样鬼鬼祟祟地靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not sneak up on me like that!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.46,1:46:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能停止抱怨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever stop bitching?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.09,1:46:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你能加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you could join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.18,1:46:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧 进入你的战斗模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay, come on, let's get your game face on.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.89,1:46:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是像电灯一样能够随意开关的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not something I can just turn on and off like a light switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.97,1:46:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形是对痛苦和情感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transformation is an electro-chemical reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.81,1:46:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种电化学反应…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pain and emotional…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.44,1:46:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾地告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to say,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.94,1:46:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这个要复杂一点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a bit more complicated than that…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.36,1:46:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到超自然调查防御局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the B.P.R.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.94,1:46:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.99,1:46:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人告诉我有着装要求啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody told me there was a dress code.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.81,1:48:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.77,1:48:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}两栖类人动物\N1865年4月14日
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.32,1:48:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「两栖类人动物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Icthyo Sapien."
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.61,1:48:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道这是什么意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.16,1:48:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}鱼人亚伯 地狱男爵的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.92,1:51:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}地狱男爵
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.45,1:51:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 丹尼小子 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ Oh, Danny boy ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.47,1:51:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad（500，500）}{\fn微软雅黑_GBK\fs16\bord1\shad0\i1\3c&H2F2F2F&}Danny Boy{\fs14}[爱尔兰民谣]{\fs}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.37,1:51:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,♪ 笛声在声声呼唤着你 ♪\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ The pipes The pipes are call… ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.17,1:51:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's fine, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.69,1:51:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}崔沃·布鲁姆\N父亲\N有很多光的地方 阴影是最深的 - 歌德
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.22,1:51:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我们完成了任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like, we got the job done and everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.64,1:51:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我装出开心的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put on a happy face.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.01,1:51:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我感觉 我说不好 感觉有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just feel, I don't know, feels kinda…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.72,1:51:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同情你 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel for you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.73,1:51:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Professor was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.31,1:51:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.82,1:51:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.02,1:51:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概经常听人这么说 我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably get this all the time. And I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.79,1:51:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己这么做很混蛋 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like such a jerk doing this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.65,1:51:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实我是你的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's like, I'm actually your biggest fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.78,1:51:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我读过你所做过的一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I… I've read about everything you've done…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.57,1:51:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我打断一下 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me stop you right there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.16,1:51:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你想看看热能手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you wanna see the claw.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.95,1:51:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.08,1:51:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.21,1:51:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.21,1:51:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.04,1:51:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你老爸不会想看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think your old man would wanna.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.29,1:51:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐在这里闷闷不乐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}see you sitting around here moping.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.08,1:52:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 你说的大概是对的 - 你得回到战斗中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you're probably right. - Gotta get back in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.01,1:52:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 战斗还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - It's unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.84,1:52:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 好 - 把我自己害死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, okay. - Got myself killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.84,1:52:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.09,1:52:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是听着 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But listen. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.39,1:52:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大战要来了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big one's coming. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.01,1:52:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了一场战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won a battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.47,1:52:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你得去战争中大打出手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you gotta go kick ass in the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.85,1:52:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.20,1:52:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.75,1:52:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.82,1:52:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别废话了 做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now cut the shit, buckle up,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.36,1:52:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到战斗中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}get back in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.61,1:52:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 龙虾队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Lobster Johnson!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.41,1:52:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.29,1:52:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 发生了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that happened.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.59,2:00:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他嘲笑我 我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He mocks me! And I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.72,2:00:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去杀了地狱男爵 把他的眼睛给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Kill Hellboy and bring me his eye!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.77,2:00:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.31,2:00:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.32,2:00:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我做到了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I do?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.57,2:00:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会实现你最大的愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will grant you your greatest wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.45,2:00:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.66,2:00:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你终于能死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will finally let you die.
